  'is-price-reduction-good-sign',
  'Is a Price Reduction a Good Sign? What It Really Means for Buyers',
  'A price reduction on a listing can mean opportunity — or a warning. Here''s how to tell the difference and use it to your advantage before making an offer.',
  '/__l5e/assets-v1/e746d594-2a33-4f14-b1b8-036376510ca3/article08-hero.jpg',
